
EVALUATION DATASET SCHEMA

column_1: user_input   
column_2: retrieved_context_ids
column_3: referenced_context_ids    
column_4: retrieved_contexts
column_5: referenced_context

COLUMN DESCRIPTIONS:

1. column_1: user_input - user's original query.
2. column_2: retrieved_context_ids - it will contain act and section number of retrieved chunks in the format(act_section_number).
3. column_3: referenced_context_ids - it will contain act and section number of ground_turth sections and acts which are actaully needed to answer user's query in the format(act_section_number).
4. column_4: retrieved_contexts - it will contain the actual retrieved top_k chunks texts.
5. column_5: referenced_context - it will contain the ground_turth texts from the actual law which are used to truly answer the question.